 FROM: MR DAVID. R. BAIL DAKAR, SENEGAL WEST AFRICA. Dear Beloved One.  Thank you for giving me your time, Please be patient and read my email to you, this letter might come as a surprise to you and you could be wondering where I got your contact. I got your address through a personal search on the internet for someone reliable and trustworthy, so I decided to contact you for an assistant, which I do hope you will take your time to consider. My name is DAVID RICH BALL, am personal political adviser to former Liberia president CHARLES TAYLOR, during his tenures in office as president, Charles Taylor who left to Nigeria for political asylum under president Olsen Obeisance, until pressure become unbearable from global world particularly the government of America and the newly elected president of Liberia for Obeisance to hand him over to Liberia government, and finally he decided to escape to Cameron where he was arrested at border between Nigeria and Cameron named Loki and finally hand over to Liberia democratic elected president for trial later end up in prison for interrogation. Now let me introduce to you the secret behind these letter which I would like you to keep the contents confidential between us, am the above name.  CHARLES TAYLOR deposited the sum of us$12.5millon (twelve million five hundred thousand United States dollar) in a security company before he left to Nigeria for asylum, as the beneficiary before he escaped to Cameroon he deposited all the document with me and later arrested by Nigeria police.I tried to escape to Dakar Senegal where am presently. Am now seeking for your assistance to enable me take out the money from the security company, and I have agreed to offer you 30% of the total sum for your assistance, 5% will be set-aside for any expenses that maybe incurred in the course of this transaction and the remaining 65% will be for me to invest in any lucrative investment. All I want you to do is to help me finish this transaction and at the same time to help me to invest some of my share of the money in a lucrative business in your country. Please get back to me via my private email address(Davidic_bala@yahoo)for better discussion or should Incas you have any questions you would like to ask, please feel free to contact me any time via my email address. Thanks and God bless as I will be looking forward to your swift and positive response. Regards, MR.DAVID. R.BAIL",i02,Information Submission,"GENERAL SETTINGS
