rvived 2 suicide bomb attacks by the special grace of God, this another reasons I will mention later has prompted me to reach out for help, Honestly want this matter to be resolved immediately. Please contact me as soon as possible. Regards, Robert Taylor_________________________________________________________________Express yourself instantly with MSN Messenger! Download today it's FREE! http://messenger.msn.click-url.com/go/onm00200471ave/direct/01/",i06,Contact and Conversation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
