6813,"Debit Card Fraud Prevention
Our Commitment Halifax Bank has stood as a symbol of strength and security, serving our customers' financial needs. Today, we remain as committed as ever and use proven technology to protect your personal information. Our Guarantee We guarantee that you will be covered for 100% of funds removed from your Halifax accounts in the unlikely event that someone you haven't authorized removes those funds through our Online Services. To qualify for this guarantee, you must follow Your Responsibilities below.  Your Responsibilities You are responsible for protecting your password and account information by: 1. Not disclosing your personal account information to others (including your ATM PIN, online username, and password).2. Protecting your account that is to enroll on the online safe pass verification. We ask you take two to three minute to enroll. To continue click on Enroll Now Note: Federal law provides certain protection to individual customers when there is unauthorized account activity. This guarantee provides additional protection from loss resulting from unauthorized activity. Thank You Helpdesk Department.",i07,Scheduling and Participation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
