1218,"[1 Day confirmation] Your account will be disabled because of fraud alert number: WTFRPCHPYS
Barclays Account Restore Dear Customer, This is an important Barclays Bank Security Message. We are sorry to inform you that your online account has been temporarily limited. Many failed login attempts have been recorded in your account, as a security measure had to temporarily limit your account. To restore your account we have attached a form to this email, please download and complete the form. Warning: For security reasons we recommend you open the Internet Explorer browser. After completing the form, within 24 hours you will be called by one of our operators to confirm the data sent, and your account will be restored. If you choose to ignore our request, you risk your account being suspended indefinitely. We advise that you keep this email for future notifications. (E-mail ID: 2233112) Note: If you have received this email in SPAM section please add to your address book banking@barclays.co.uk We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused. Honestly, BARCLAYS Security Department. Barclays Bank PLC. Registered in England. Barclays Bank PLC is authorized and regulated by the Financial Services Authority (FSA). Registered No 1026167. Barclays Insurance Services Company Limited is authorized and regulated by the FSA. Registered No 973765. Registered Office for both: 1 Churchill Place, London, E14 5HP. quot;The Woolwich&quot; and quot;Woolwich&quot; are trademarks and trading names of Barclays Bank PLC. Barclays Business is a trading name of Barclays Bank PLC. Barclays Bank PLC subscribes to the Lending Code which is monitored and enforced by the Lending Standards Board and is licensed and regulated by the Office of Fair Trading for the provision of credit products to consumers and related services. Further details can be found at www.lendingstandardsboard.org.uk Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat4', 'code' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/js/Barclays.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E', 'replace' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/js/stub code/Barclays.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E'}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat2', 'code' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/foresee/foresee-trigger.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E', 'replace' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/js/stub code/foresee-trigger.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E'}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat2', 'code' : '%3Cscript%20language%3D%22javascript%22%20type%3D%22text%2Fjavascript%22%3E%20var%20s_code%3Ds.t%28%29%3Bif%28s_code%29document.write%28s_code%29%3B%3C%2Fscript%3E', 'replace' : ''}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat2,cat3', 'code' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/js/logging.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E%0A%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20if%28%24.find%28%22div.tcContent%22%29.length%3E0%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20tc.containers%20%3D%5B%5D.concat%28pageContainers%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20omtr.TC.init%28%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%3C/script%3E', 'replace' : '%3Cscript%20type%3D%22text/javascript%22%20src%3D%22/js/stub code/logging.js%22%3E%3C/script%3E'}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat4', 'code' : '%3Cimg%20src%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fadfarm.medial.com%2Fad%2Fbk%2F7648-49630-3840-0%3Fbarclays_landing_page%3D1%26amp%3Bmpuid%3D%22%20height%3D%221%22%20width%3D%221%22%20alt%3D%22%22%20%2F%3E', 'replace' : ''}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat4', 'code' : '%3Cimg%20class%3D%22cachebuster%22%20src%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fadfarm.medial.com%2Fad%2Fbk%2F7648-49630-3840-0%3FBA_Branders_NP_Homepage_LP_2011%3D1%26amp%3Bmpuid%3D%22%20height%3D%221%22%20width%3D%221%22%20alt%3D%22%22%20%2F%3E', 'replace' : ''}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat4', 'code' : '%3Cimg%20src%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fa.tribal fusion.com%2Fi.cid%3Fc%3D411303%26ev%3D2%26page%3Dbarclayshomepage%27%20width%3D%271%27%20height%3D%271%27%20border%3D%270%27%3E', 'replace' : ''}); Barclays.privacy.gateway({'cat' : 'cat4', 'code' : '%3Cimg%20src%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Faltfarm.medial.com%2Fad%2Fbk%2F7648-4